&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A career driven by you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Join our Product Management team in designing and managing the product vision. You’ll work independently, setting the&amp;nbsp;north star, defining the scope, executing freely, and leading from behind. Consider it your own, mini-start-up. You’ll work&amp;nbsp;untethered, focused on the user, with modern tools in a dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Define vision as well as business goals for the Engagement product area within the AutoScout24 buyer experience, focusing on driving user activation, engagement, and retention and translate them into a strategy and concrete product streams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Develop a product roadmap and milestones that reflect expected engagement outcomes, using data insights and experimentation to inform prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Align priorities across the product organization with stakeholders, ensuring your work supports broader company goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end product lifecycle in your cross-functional team: deeply understand the customer, develop hypotheses, validate ideas through A/B testing, and iterate based on results. Collaborate to craft culture with our top tier leadership team while mentoring and coaching PMs and those around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Establish, support, and ensure compliance of company product management methods and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Define success metrics around engagement and retention, and regularly communicate performance, learnings, and impact across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Digital product management experience, preferably in Marketplaces or eCommerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Strong customer focus with proven track record of building products from MVP to “world-class” using insights from tracking, user testing and A/B tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ideally knowledge in conversion rate optimisation (CRO) as well as testing frameworks and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Very good analytical skills with the ability to use data to backup ideas and assumptions, develop insights and recommendations and define and measure success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Self-management, negotiation technique, conflict management and strategic thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Strong business knowledge and team development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Extensive know-how of common product management tools and knowledge of target groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Product and cross-departmental entrepreneurial thinking and acting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director for Lifecycle, CC Outbound, owns the outbound call center channel strategy and performance for millions of former customers across all 17 of our international markets and all our brands. We are looking for a CRM expert, who is interested in running strategy for Call Center, with a high level of autonomy and agility. You will own the strategic development, performance and strategic innovations for this channel, working closely with the Call Center Operations team. Your scope includes steering performance and managing budgets, implementing strategies that will unlock a better customer experience, under consideration of country-specific idiosyncrasies. It also means developing this channel into one of our prime sources of insight to customer sentiment and inspiration for product improvements at scale (e.g., through the use of AI tools). Moreover, you will own the performance of this channel, which includes setting targets together with our local market CMOs and day-to-day steering of conversions, cost and ROI together with our VP of customer care and his operations managers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to own a critical channel for one of our most valuable customer groups and develop a strong muscle in driving CRM strategy and execution, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM Strategy Development:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement annual strategic plans for Call Centre Outbound initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the CC Outbound for the full customer lifecycle, from leads to reactivation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with CC Operations, cross-functional teams, local markets and international marketing leadership to align strategies with overall business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personalization of Customer Interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with L&amp;amp;D, Brand and local teams to enrich the training for agents, adding the local context, address the customer needs and have the best pitch for the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test personalized offers for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize AI tools to improve customer interactions and call content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call Centre Outbound Campaign Management:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute outbound communication campaigns. Provide guidance on campaign targeting, messaging, incentives and timing to maximize conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and steer campaign performance, maximizing ROI and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all outbound communication activities comply with relevant regulations and internal expectations (e.g., via quality assurance measures)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Analysis and Tech Tooling:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data analysis to identify, test and evaluate impactful reactivation strategies and improvement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and implement CRM tools to enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of outbound initiatives, coordinating with Call Center Operations and CommsTech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in and a passion for delivering excellent and effective customer experiences (e.g., working in CRM/Lifecycle Marketing, campaign management, Product, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with an ability to influence and motivate people at all levels within international environments and across a broad variety of job functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mentality and drive to deliver results, including experience with prioritizing for highest impact and managing trade-off decisions in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to derive actionable insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally hands-on experience working with or in Call Centres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally experience in Experimentation/Testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern and comfortable working space with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development possibilities along with internal trainings and a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours including Work From Home/Work from Abroad/Sabbatical Policy, as well as a home office set up budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive Onboarding and Buddy Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted fitness offers with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners and yoga classes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-being initiatives in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Childcare and company pension scheme benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly transportation budget via NAVIT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within Global Customer Experience (GCX), our mission is to advance the HelloFresh customer relationship from reactive resolution to proactive, trust-building service. The compensation function sits at the heart of that mission: it is the mechanism through which the business acknowledges failures, restores customer confidence, and, when done well, turns a bad experience into a reason to stay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director, Customer Compensation &amp;amp; Policy is responsible for the global strategy, architecture, and governance of how HelloFresh compensates customers across all markets and brands. This is not a policy maintenance role. It is a strategic function that sits at the intersection of customer economics, operational data, behavioral experimentation, and cross-functional influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own one of the most financially material and customer-sensitive levers in the business. You will shape a multi-year roadmap and hold peers in Operations, Technology, Finance, and Market Leadership accountable for the quality of inputs that determine how well and how efficiently we recover customer trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The ideal candidate brings a rare combination: analytical rigor sharp enough to architect a global compensation engine from first principles, and the executive presence to drive adoption across a complex, multi-market organization without formal authority over most of the people they need to move.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Global Compensation Strategy &amp;amp; Engine Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end strategic vision for how HelloFresh categorizes customer errors and determines compensation across all markets, brands, and contact channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and continuous evolution of the compensation engine: along with Tech, you’ll define the the rules, thresholds, segmentation logic, and automation frameworks that govern recovery decisions at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the principles that govern trade-offs between customer generosity and cost discipline and translate those principles into operational rules that hold across market complexity and brand variation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology to ensure the compensation engine is scalable, auditable, and capable of supporting dynamic, AI-assisted decisioning as the product evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation &amp;amp; Behavioral Economics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the global roadmap for compensation experimentation: A/B testing across offer types, value levels, channel timing, and segmentation variables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply behavioral economics frameworks to compensation design understanding how recovery offers shape long-term retention, repurchase behavior, and brand perception, not just immediate satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the measurement framework for experimentation: what constitutes a successful test, what confidence warrants global rollout, and how results are synthesized into durable policy change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics &amp;amp; Insights to ensure test design, sample integrity, and rollout analysis meet a rigorous standard of evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Stewardship &amp;amp; Cost Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global compensation P&amp;amp;L line: tracking spend by market, error category, customer segment, and channel — and holding yourself accountable to defined cost-per-incident and avoidable-contact targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close financial leakage: cases where compensation is being issued without policy justification, at incorrect values, or at the wrong frequency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the reporting infrastructure that makes compensation economics visible to GCX leadership, market GMs, and Finance — with the granularity and context needed to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the right balance between cost optimization and customer lifetime value investment: not just &#39;spend less&#39; but &#39;spend where it earns back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Policy &amp;amp; Global Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global fraud and abuse prevention framework: the policies, detection logic, thresholds, and escalation paths that protect the business without creating friction for genuine customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the governance rhythm for policy: quarterly reviews, market exception management, escalation adjudication, and framework versioning across a multi-brand, multi-market environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final authority on complex, cross-market policy gaps — resolving ambiguity with speed, consistency, and strategic clarity rather than routing decisions upward by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain global standards while creating principled space for market-level adaptation where local context genuinely requires it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the compensation function in senior forums translating customer economics into requirements that peers in Operations, Technology, Finance, and Market GMs must respond to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold cross-functional partners accountable for the upstream data quality, operational accuracy, and system reliability that the compensation engine depends on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of policy changes across markets and brands, building communication and change management plans that make new frameworks land — not just launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence at VP and Director level across multiple functions; escalate only strategic blockers, not routine alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or equivalent postgraduate qualification required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in Economics, Business, Engineering, or a quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12 years of progressive experience in customer strategy, pricing, operations, or a directly adjacent domain with meaningful exposure to global, multi-market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of owning a financially significant operational lever and managing it with both analytical precision and strategic judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading and developing teams; comfort operating as a senior individual contributor and a people leader simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in subscription commerce, logistics, or consumer-facing operations strongly preferred. Familiarity with the economics of customer recovery in high-volume, low-margin environments is a distinct advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Analytical&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL and data analysis; able to build and pressure-test the analytical models that underpin policy decisions without delegating the logic to others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with experimentation methodology: test design, statistical significance, holdout analysis, and the translation of results into policy not just reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or alongside engineering teams to define product and system requirements for rules-based or AI-assisted decisioning tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with financial modeling: building the business case for compensation investment, forecasting spend impact, and tracking actuals against plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior executive presence: able to walk into a GM, COO, or CFO conversation with a clear point of view, defend it under pressure, and leave with alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A credible voice with peers and upward stakeholders not because of title, but because of the quality of analysis and clarity of communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and decisive under ambiguity: able to make a defensible call with incomplete information and adjust as evidence develops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely collaborative across markets and functions able to hold people to standards without damaging the relationships needed to sustain them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Modern and comfortable working space with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discount for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Development possibilities along with internal trainings and a yearly Learning &amp;amp; Development budget&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexible working hours including Work From Home/Work from Abroad/Sabbatical Policy, as well as a home office set up budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Extensive Onboarding and Buddy Program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Social events including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Discounted fitness offers with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners and yoga classes&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Well-being initiatives in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Childcare and company pension scheme benefit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
